  "answer": "The Voyager paper does not use any GPU hardware or training hours for fine-tuning because it does not fine-tune a policy network [C1]. Instead, Voyager operates by interacting with GPT-4 via black-box queries, bypassing the need for model parameter fine-tuning [C1]. Motor controls and environmental interactions are handled through MineDojo and Mineflayer JavaScript APIs [C8]. Consequently, no training GPUs or training durations are reported."
